{"a":[58,60],"h":"<p>58.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"142\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 142.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 30.0 30.0 37.4 37.4 44.2 60.0 66.7 66.7 73.4 94.4 101.2 101.2 110.2 117.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 44.2 60.0 73.4 101.2 110.2 117.7 126.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Vaktâ ki emrimiz geldi - ya'ni yine dinlemediler, azâba istihkak kesbettiler, azâb emrimiz geldi çattı, o vakıt<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"244\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 244.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.0 45.7 52.6 60.7 60.7 67.6 74.3 74.3 90.0 100.6 107.3 107.3 116.3 116.3 123.7 130.6 147.7 154.6 154.6 162.0 170.3 170.3 188.3 195.0 201.7 201.7 208.6 208.6 221.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 30.0 67.6 90.0 116.3 130.6 195.0 208.6 221.3 228.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Hûdü ve beraberinde iyman edenleri<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"104\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 104.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 45.8 45.8 52.6 61.6 61.6 73.6 81.0 81.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 15.0 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 52.6 73.6 87.8\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tarafımızdan bir rahmet ile kurtardık « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"48\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 48.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 18.7 18.7 30.7 38.3 38.3\" y=\"25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 30.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » de «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"20\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 19.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » sebebiyy ve rahmetin tenvini, tefhım içindir ki tarafımızdan büyük bir rahmet sebebile demektir. Ve bu büyük rahmetten murad da iyman ni'metine hidayet ve tevkıftır. - <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"220\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 220.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 30.0 36.7 36.7 43.6 61.6 61.6 78.0 84.7 93.7 111.7 111.7 122.3 122.3 138.0 138.0 147.0 147.0 156.0 162.7 169.6 169.6 176.3 176.3 189.0 195.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"43.6 84.7 93.7 162.7 176.3 189.0 195.7 204.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve biz bunları galîz bir azâbdan kurtardık - ya'ni iyman etmiyenler şiddetli ve şümullü ağır bir azâb ile ihlâk edilirlerken Hûd ve mü'minler böyle büyük bir tehlükeden necat buldular. Bu galîz azâb, azâbı semumdur ki bir rıhı sarsar, kâfirlerin burnundan giriyor kıçlarından çıkıyor, evlerini, mallarını yıkıb süpürüb götürüyor, her birini bir tarafa atıb parça parça ediyordu. Ma'ahaza ba'zı müfessirîn burada diğer bir ma'nâ olduğunu söylemişler: iki kerre «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 46.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.7 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 36.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"9.7 23.3 36.0\" y=\"26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » buyurulmasında te'sis, te'kide racih olduğu cihetle beyan olunan ma'nâ, birincinin mazmunu olub azâbı galîzden murad, Âhiret azâbıdır demişler ki güzel bir ma'nâdır. Ve netekim bundan sonraki âyette hem Dünya hem Kıyamet tasrih olunmuştur. Bu surette ma'nâ şu olur: «biz bunları galîz bir azâbdan da kurtardık» Ey muhatap <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"31\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 20.8 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 4.6 11.4 11.6 13.7 14.8\" y=\"16.1 18.0 16.1 17.1 13.2 16.1\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> tâ onlar işte – bugün gider dolaşırsanız manzûrunuz olabilecek olan o harap eserler, kabirlerdir işte <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 18.4 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.1 6.7 10.2 10.4\" y=\"17.9 14.9 14.9 14.9 18.0\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> Âd – bunlar neye böyle oldular, o azâb-ı galîze uğradılar bilir misiniz? <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"47\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 31.0 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 6.3 10.9 11.3 15.8 16.2 21.8 22.2\" y=\"14.9 14.9 14.9 17.3 14.9 18.0 14.9 18.0\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 46.8 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.7 7.3 7.8 10.0 10.7 14.4 14.4 21.1 23.8 30.7 33.7 34.2 37.2 37.2 39.9 40.7\" y=\"12.7 15.6 11.0 12.7 11.0 18.0 15.8 12.7 12.7 9.8 12.7 15.8 12.7 12.7 12.7 11.0 12.7\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> Rablerinin -yani Allah’ın- âyâtını inkâr ettiler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"76\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 50.4 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 6.5 7.1 10.5 11.7 16.4 16.7 23.1 26.4 27.2 30.7 31.6 37.5 37.7 42.8 43.2\" y=\"16.2 13.2 13.9 13.2 13.2 18.0 13.2 16.8 13.2 13.2 16.6 13.2 17.5 13.2 16.3 13.2 16.3\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> ve O’nun resullerine isyan ettiler – bunlara gönderilen Hûd aleyhisselâm ise de bunun teblîğātı esas itibariyle evvelki peygamberlerin de teblîğātına mutabık olduğundan ona isyan etmekle hepsine isyan ettiler. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"73\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 48.4 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 7.6 8.5 12.2 12.4 18.3 21.6 24.7 25.9 25.9 29.4 29.7 33.7 34.4 37.5 40.8 41.1\" y=\"17.5 14.4 14.4 17.8 15.1 14.4 14.4 14.4 14.2 18.0 14.4 17.5 14.4 15.7 14.4 14.4 14.4 17.5\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"90\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 60.3 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.5 7.9 12.6 14.0 17.3 17.5 25.5 25.6 29.6 32.6 33.0 37.8 38.1 47.0 48.3 49.6 53.0 53.0\" y=\"14.9 13.1 14.9 14.9 13.3 14.9 18.0 14.3 14.9 14.9 17.4 14.9 14.9 18.0 14.9 13.8 17.3 16.1 14.9\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> Ve her anûd cebbârın emrine ittibâ‘ eylediler – her inatçı zorbanın arkasına düştüler <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"155\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 103.5 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.6 7.7 7.9 12.6 13.1 15.8 16.4 22.1 25.3 25.6 30.3 30.6 33.4 33.7 38.2 40.9 47.0 47.2 50.4 50.5 55.2 55.8 62.8 68.0 73.5 76.8 81.0 81.0 84.8 85.2 89.6 89.8 92.3 92.6 95.9 96.3\" y=\"16.8 14.4 16.9 14.4 14.4 17.8 14.8 14.4 14.4 17.5 14.4 14.4 17.2 14.4 15.7 14.4 14.4 11.5 14.4 14.4 11.5 14.4 17.4 14.4 13.9 14.4 14.4 18.0 14.4 14.4 12.7 14.4 16.6 15.8 14.4 14.4 17.5\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> kendileri de hem bu dünyada lânetle tâkip olundular <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 49.0 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.2 7.5 7.5 12.9 13.2 17.6 17.9 21.8 22.0 24.5 30.6 30.8 34.5 35.2 38.0 38.8 41.4 41.8\" y=\"11.7 14.6 17.7 14.6 14.6 17.6 14.6 11.7 14.6 15.2 14.6 17.1 14.6 14.6 18.0 17.7 14.6 14.6 17.7\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> hem de kıyamet gününde. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"138\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.0 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.7 7.6 7.8 10.1 14.4 14.4 22.1 25.5 30.1 30.3 34.7 34.7 38.7 38.9 47.1 48.6 50.4 53.9 57.4 57.7 66.5 66.6 71.6 71.8 78.9 81.1 82.1 85.4 85.7\" y=\"13.2 16.0 18.0 13.2 16.9 16.3 13.2 13.2 13.2 13.2 16.8 15.1 13.2 13.9 13.2 13.2 16.2 13.2 13.2 13.2 16.3 13.2 15.1 9.7 13.2 13.2 10.5 13.1 13.9 13.2\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> Evet, Âd hakikaten Rabbine küfr etti <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"78\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 52.1 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.2 6.6 9.8 10.0 13.0 13.8 20.3 21.8 23.6 28.4 29.0 32.0 32.3 39.1 42.3 45.6 45.8\" y=\"14.4 12.6 14.4 17.5 14.4 10.9 14.4 14.4 17.4 14.4 14.4 17.8 18.0 14.4 14.4 14.3 15.1 14.4\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"49\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 32.7 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.2 6.6 10.8 11.1 18.5 18.7 22.2 22.9 26.2 26.4\" y=\"14.4 12.6 14.4 14.4 18.0 14.4 14.2 14.4 17.8 16.3 14.4\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> evet, defolsun o Âd: kavm-i Hûd. – İşte <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"163\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 108.6 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 6.0 6.5 11.2 11.7 19.1 19.8 23.9 23.9 27.4 28.5 33.8 33.8 38.7 39.2 45.1 45.4 50.0 50.2 56.7 57.4 61.5 61.5 65.0 65.0 68.8 69.1 69.2 73.5 73.5 78.9 78.9 83.6 84.6 92.7 92.9 97.5 97.6 102.3 102.3\" y=\"13.7 15.6 13.7 13.7 10.2 13.7 16.5 17.3 13.7 13.7 17.3 16.8 13.7 16.8 13.7 15.6 13.7 16.1 13.7 13.7 16.5 17.3 13.7 17.3 13.7 13.7 10.8 17.6 16.8 13.7 16.7 13.7 13.7 18.0 13.7 16.7 13.7 16.8 14.9 13.7\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"71\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 47.3 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 3.2 7.8 12.5 12.8 15.0 15.2 21.2 24.2 30.9 34.2 34.3 39.0 39.3\" y=\"13.2 16.2 13.2 13.2 11.0 13.9 13.2 13.2 18.0 13.2 13.2 13.9 13.2 16.3\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> ’den biri ki bunlara <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.0 28.2\"><text x=\"3.0 6.4 10.2 10.4 14.3 15.0 18.9 21.7 26.0 27.8 29.3 31.1 34.6 38.1 38.3 46.1 47.7 54.0 54.6 57.9 58.7 62.2 62.4 67.3 68.5 68.5 72.6 74.3 75.0 77.4 78.0 81.4 81.7\" y=\"14.6 14.6 14.0 14.6 15.2 14.6 14.8 14.6 10.9 14.6 17.6 14.6 14.6 14.6 17.7 14.6 16.5 15.3 14.6 14.6 18.0 15.3 14.6 13.8 17.6 14.6 14.6 16.5 14.6 15.4 14.6 14.6 17.7\" class=\"T2872\" font-size=\"12.0\"></text></svg> buyurduğu üzere Âd-ı Ûlâ denilir.</p><p>3:</p>"}